            "Buff duration is 8 seconds",
            "Buff grants Allies (1-37) to (2-56) added Cold damage to Attacks",
            "Empowered Attacks deal (4-121) to (5-186) additional Cold damage",
            "Empowers one Attack per 5 enemy Power in",
            "range, counting up to 50 Power"
